G-BL2|book-learner-interest-gate|~2h|ticket=#214
  what=Igor can't say "this no longer interests me" to stop slow reading
  fix=TWM signal + habit that sets IGOR_READING_STOP flag; ebook_reader checks it each chunk
  trigger=after book learner habit wired

G42|thread-context-complexity-inflation|~2h|ticket=#none
  what=complexity scorer reads full assembled input (preamble+message) not parsed.core_input
  symptom=greetings with thread context → tier.3.5-4 all day; cost inflated
  fix=run complexity scoring on parsed.core_input only
  trigger=fix before performance sprint

G46|memory-model-fields|~3h|HIGH_INERTIA_CAREFUL
  what=Memory dataclass missing: source(str), confidence(float 0-1), context_of_encoding(dict VAD+note)
  why=source enables trust tiers; confidence affects retrieval weighting; context_of_encoding = amygdala analog (high-arousal encoding → crystallized)
  blocker=models.py HIGH inertia; requires cortex.py migration + all seed scripts updated
  trigger=when Memory model design is stable enough to commit to schema change

G63|routing-self-awareness|~2h
  what=Igor writes plans saying "local inference" but D035 overrides tier.2 unconditionally for interactive turns
  symptom=Igor's stated plans contradict actual routing; incorrect cost model in self-generated plans
  fix=seed PROC_ROUTING_INTROSPECTION: accurate narrative of live routing stack (D035 floor=t3.5 for interactive; t2=background/NE/impulse only)
  trigger=any session where Igor is planning his own work

